From 904c8663c2c355f75d5f7461c774f678e94cac09 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Donach's Bot <bot@braiins.cz>
Date: Thu, 30 Jul 2026 19:09:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] vulkan: wide n==1 ternary/binary mul_mat_vec path + GCN
 tuning knobs

- Q1_0/Q2_0 get packed16 struct views (2-byte aligned loads; 18/34-byte
  blocks preclude packed32)
- dedicated TERNARY_WIDE mul_mat_vec variant for single-column dispatches:
  32 weights/thread/iter, activations staged in registers, dot computed as
  fma(code, b) with one correction term (no dequantized weights)
- generic path retained for batched (NUM_COLS>1) matvec: wide variant's
  register pressure regresses n=2..8
- GGML_VK_TERNARY_ROWS: rows/workgroup for the n==1 ternary pipelines
- GGML_VK_GCN_SUBGROUP_REDUCE: opt GCN into subgroup reductions
---
 ggml/src/ggml-vulkan/ggml-vulkan.cpp          | 27 +++++--
 .../vulkan-shaders/mul_mat_vec.comp           | 80 ++++++++++++++++++-
 .../src/ggml-vulkan/vulkan-shaders/types.glsl | 18 +++++
 .../vulkan-shaders/vulkan-shaders-gen.cpp     | 20 +++++
 4 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 9 deletions(-)

